<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Browning-Ferris cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Browning-Ferris cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Friday it downgraded  Browning-Ferris Industries Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- In research note, analyst Joel Tiss said, &quot;We continue to believe  that the company will make steady sustainable progress but are concerned  that the pace of improvement ... may prove too slow to argue for further  multiple expansion.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Kept target price range at $38-40 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-7/16 to 35-9/16.</p>
</text>
